  "lavender.alchemy_book.recipes": "Compendium of recipes for potions, decoctions, monster oils, bombs, and alchemical ingredients.",
  "modmenu.descriptionTranslation.tcots_witcher": "New monsters, armors, weapons, potions and challenges from the Witcher Universe, beware, The Conjunction of the Spheres!",
  "modmenu.nameTranslation.tcots_witcher": "The Conjunction of the Spheres",
  "patchouli.tcots_witcher.alchemy_book.landing_page": "To understand alchemy, you must understand two great truths.$(li)First truth: \"As above, so below.\"$(li)Second truth: \"Everything is one.\"$(br2)These truths teach that alchemical substances are everywhere around you, this is because alchemy is life, and life is alchemy.",
  "patchouli.tcots_witcher.witcher_bestiary.landing_page": "\"The Conjunction of the Spheres\", this name, so mysterious to a commoner's ear, could be replaced with a much simpler alternative: When the Worlds Collided.$(br2)Learn everything you can about this post-conjunction world if you want to survive, fellow warrior.",
